B.c_m=new A.y3("Suhoor \u2014 The Blessed Meal","The Prophet \ufdfa said: take suhoor, for in suhoor there is blessing (Bukhari 1923). Eat before dawn; the angels seek forgiveness for the one who takes suhoor.")
B.c_p=new A.y3("Iftar \u2014 The Breaking","The Prophet \ufdfa broke his fast with dates and water, and said: the fasting person has a dua at the time of breaking that is not rejected (Ibn Majah 1753, hasan per Darussalam). Break it with dates if you can; make the dua with intention.")
