B.aWW=s(["\u09e7\u09ae\u0983 \u09a4\u09bf\u0983","\u09e8\u09af\u09bc\u0983 \u09a4\u09bf\u0983","\u09e9\u09af\u09bc\u0983 \u09a4\u09bf\u0983","\u09ea\u09f0\u09cd\u09a5\u0983 \u09a4\u09bf\u0983"],t.s)
B.c34=new A.q9("The Honor You Were Born With","Allah says He honored the children of Adam (17:70) \u2014 not some of them, not the famous ones. The bullying at school, the stares on the street \u2014 they are real, and they are not the verdict. The verdict was issued by the One who made you.",u.dH)
B.c36=new A.q9("Chosen \u2014 Adam's Answer","When Allah announced the khilafah to the angels, they asked about one who sheds blood; He said: I know that which you do not know (2:30). You were created with a purpose the angels could not see. Doubt about your worth is not humility \u2014 it is a miscount.","Name one thing you are good at that could serve the ummah \u2014 even small. That is the 'which you do not know' spoken over you.")
B.c38=new A.q9("The Best Generation","The Prophet \ufdfa said the best generation is his, then the next, then the next (Bukhari 2652). You are not a latecomer to the deen \u2014 you are the generation the hadith was waiting for.","Pick one sunnah of the Prophet \ufdfa you can practice this week that your friends will notice \u2014 and let them ask about it.")
B.aDB=s([B.c34,B.c36,B.c38],t.gB)
B.c3d=new A.Qy("Identity \u2014 Who You Are","Seventy percent of young Muslims have faced Islamophobia; the question 'who am I?' arrives earlier than it used to. The answer arrived first: you are a khaleefah \u2014 a successor of Adam (2:30), created with purpose, honored above much of creation (17:70).",B.aDB)
B.c35=new A.q9("The Scroll That Eats the Hour","The five prayers are five anchors a day; the feed is a current that pulls you under for hours. Screens can make strangers of us at our own dinner tables.",u.lu)
B.c3b=new A.q9("The Feed Is Not Real","You are comparing your inside to everyone else's outside. The filtered life is a storefront, not a home \u2014 and the Prophet \ufdfa said Allah does not look at your appearances or wealth but at your hearts and deeds (Muslim 2564), not likes.",u.hl)
B.c3c=new A.q9("Guarding the Gaze","Tell the believing men to lower their gaze and guard their chastity (24:30) \u2014 and the believing women likewise (24:31). The screen made the gaze the easiest sin in history; the verse did not change. Your eyes are an amanah too.",u.oq)
B.aFN=s([B.c35,B.c3b,B.c3c],t.gB)
B.c3e=new A.Qy("The Phone \u2014 Your Twenty-First Century Companion","The average teenager checks their phone over a hundred times a day. The Prophet \ufdfa said the strong is the one who controls himself (Bukhari 6114) \u2014 he just never imagined the controller would glow.",B.aFN)
B.c37=new A.q9("You Are the Average of Your Five","A person is upon the religion of his friend \u2014 so let one of you look at whom he befriends (Tirmidhi 2378, hasan per Darussalam). The friend who drags you to prayer is worth more than the one who drags you to everything else. Choose the friend your future self will thank you for.",u.aH)
B.c3a=new A.q9("Halal Money \u2014 Even the Penny","The Prophet \ufdfa said: leave that which makes you doubt for that which does not (Tirmidhi 2518, sahih per Darussalam). The gig economy, the hustle, the side scheme \u2014 the barakah is in the clean dirham, even when the unclean one is bigger.",u.bE)
B.c39=new A.q9("Seven Under the Shade","Seven whom Allah will shade on the Day there is no shade but His \u2014 among them a youth who grew up in the worship of Allah (Bukhari 660). The hadith names the youth specifically. Your energy, your free evenings, your strong memory \u2014 they are capital no billionaire can buy back.","Spend thirty minutes this week on one act of worship you cannot do when you are older and busier \u2014 memorization, night prayer, learning Arabic.")
B.aBE=s([B.c37,B.c3a,B.c39],t.gB)
B.c3f=new A.Qy("Friends & Money","The two currencies of youth: the people around you and the money you do not yet have. Both are tests.",B.aBE)
B.aWZ=s([B.c3d,B.c3e,B.c3f],A.ac("y<Qy>"))
